<title>USA: Barrett Business acquires unit for cash.</title>
<headline>Barrett Business acquires unit for cash.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrett Business Services Inc said on Thursday it has acquired the staff leasing division of a Californian staffing services company for $660,000 in cash.</p>
<p>The acquisition of the division, which had revenues for fiscal 1996 of about $10.5 million, will be effective on November 4.</p>
<p>Barrett did not name the Californian company.</p>
<p>Barrett, a human resource management company, had 1995 revenues of $179.8 million and net income of $4.1 million.</p>
